  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Transaction Attribute",
      "id": "details-transaction-attribute",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Transaction Attribute berfungsi untuk memetakan field dari file XLSX ke dalam atribut transaksi standar yang dikenali oleh engine deteksi fraud. Setiap atribut menentukan dari mana data diambil (HEADER, BODY, atau QUERY_PARAM) dan bagaimana data tersebut diterjemahkan ke dalam sistem.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Transaction Attribute",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel menampilkan atribut transaksi yang terdaftar untuk Message Type terpilih.\n• Pilih endpoint dari panel **List Endpoint** di sidebar kiri untuk memuat atribut terkait.\n• Informasi kolom mencakup:\n  - **Attribute Name:** Nama atribut transaksi standar (contoh: CARD_NUMBER, TRANSACTION_AMOUNT).\n  - **Field Tag:** Identifier unik field di skema XLSX dengan badge light.\n  - **Source Data:** Menandakan lokasi sumber data dengan badge berwarna (HEADER, BODY, QUERY_PARAM).\n• Atribut bertipe **MAIN** tidak dapat dihapus karena dianggap critical.\n• Gunakan tombol **Add Attribute** untuk menambahkan atribut baru.",
          "color": "#107c41",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Transaction Attribute</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Attribute</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Tag</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Source</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">CARD_NUMBER</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">card_no</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(20,184,166,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">BODY</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">TRX_AMOUNT</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">amount</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(20,184,166,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">BODY</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Attribute",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form menyediakan field berikut:\n1. **Attribute Name** *(Wajib)*: Nama atribut transaksi standar yang akan dipetakan.\n2. **Field Tag** *(Wajib)*: Identifier unik untuk mereferensikan field di skema XLSX.\n3. **Source Data** *(Wajib)*: Pilih lokasi sumber data — HEADER, BODY, atau QUERY_PARAM.\n4. **Attribute Type** *(Wajib)*: Pilih MAIN (atribut critical, tidak dapat dihapus) atau ADDITIONAL (atribut tambahan).\n5. **Description** *(Opsional)*: Deskripsi singkat kegunaan atribut.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#107c41;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Transaction Attribute</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Map XLSX field to attribute</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter attribute</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Field Tag <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter tag</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Source <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose type</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
